### **Methods to Add/Replace in JournalRequestServiceImpl.java**
#### **1. Add these New Methods (Inside the Class Body)**
Add these two methods before the // --- Overrides --- section. They directly call your new repository methods using the PENDING status to filter the results.
```java
    /**
     * SEARCH BY BRANCH (STARTS WITH)
     * Rule: Specifically filters by PENDING status for the Authorization screen.
     * Logic: Passes the prefix to the repository which uses 'LIKE branch%'
     */
    public Page<JournalRequest> searchPendingByBranchPrefix(String branchPrefix, Pageable pageable) {
        log.info("SEARCH_BRANCH_PREFIX | Prefix: {} | Page: {}", branchPrefix, pageable.getPageNumber());
        return journalRequestRepository.findByReqBranchCodeStartingWithAndRequestStatus(
                branchPrefix, 
                RequestStatus.PENDING, 
                pageable
        );
    }

    /**
     * SEARCH BY CGL (STARTS WITH)
     * Rule: Strictly matches the beginning of the CGL string.
     * Optimization: Allows Oracle to perform an Index Range Scan.
     */
    public Page<JournalRequest> searchPendingByCglPrefix(String cglPrefix, Pageable pageable) {
        log.info("SEARCH_CGL_PREFIX | Prefix: {} | Page: {}", cglPrefix, pageable.getPageNumber());
        return journalRequestRepository.findByReqCglStartingWithAndRequestStatus(
                cglPrefix, 
                RequestStatus.PENDING, 
                pageable
        );
    }

```
